  (gr_text "Height: F 3.0 mm max (2.5 under keycap flanges, 1.4 under the OLED glass). B: encoders 6.5; nothing else inside R17.4 of each dial axis." (at 100.1 131.8) (layer "Cmts.User") (tstamp 7785a395-2f1d-4b62-8010-5c82ccd998fa)
