  )
  (gr_text "Viewed from above; F.Cu = top side (keys, OLED, status LEDs). B.Cu: encoders, OLED FPC connector, JST SH, IO expander." (at 100.1 127.4) (layer "Cmts.User") (tstamp a73e2f57-6e97-4ae8-98ba-cdd7ae2ce922)
